{"id":73630,"date":"2026-11-10T06:57:42","date_gmt":"2026-11-10T06:57:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=73630"},"modified":"2026-11-10T07:59:56","modified_gmt":"2026-11-10T06:59:56","slug":"corrida-do-madeiro-alhandra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-do-madeiro-alhandra\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida do Madeiro \u2013 Alhandra 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida do Madeiro \u2013 Alhandra 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida do Madeiro \u2013 Alhandra 2027<\/strong> (1\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>16 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com partida \u00e0s <strong>18:00<\/strong> na <strong>Zona Ribeirinha de Alhandra<\/strong> (junto \u00e0 Est\u00e1tua, ao lado da sede da Sociedade Euterpe Alhandrense), no concelho de <strong>Vila Franca de Xira<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. O evento \u00e9 organizado pela <strong>Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias de Alhandra, S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o dos Montes e Calhandriz<\/strong> e tem um limite m\u00e1ximo de 1.500 participantes.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo \u00e9 composto por tr\u00eas vertentes ao final da tarde: a <strong>Corrida Kids<\/strong> que abre o evento \u00e0s 17:15, a prova principal de <strong>Corrida de Estrada (10 km)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s 18:00 (destinada a atletas a partir dos 15 anos) e a <strong>Caminhada (5 km)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s 18:10, dispondo de um tempo limite global de 2 horas.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem dorsal (com chip RFID nos 10 km), t-shirt t\u00e9cnica na Corrida de 10 km e t-shirt de algod\u00e3o na Caminhada de 5 km, medalha Finisher, abastecimento aos 5 km e na meta, seguro desportivo, banhos e op\u00e7\u00e3o de jantar conv\u00edvio (Sopa da Pedra e Bifana). Descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a> e calcula o teu ritmo na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">16 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Zona Ribeirinha de Alhandra, Vila Franca de Xira, Lisboa<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km e 5 km<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;