div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 16 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:00 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: 2h00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 11,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora:<\/strong> 17,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 5 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 16 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:10 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: 2h00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 8,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora:<\/strong> 14,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Jovem<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida Kids<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 16 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 17:15<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Kids:<\/strong> Gratuita (com familiar pagante inscrito)<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida do Madeiro \u2013 Alhandra 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 1\u00aa Corrida do Madeiro de Alhandra realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 16 de Janeiro de 2027, na Zona Ribeirinha de Alhandra (junto \u00e0 Est\u00e1tua, ao lado da sede da Sociedade Euterpe Alhandrense), no concelho de Vila Franca de Xira (Lisboa). A Corrida Kids parte \u00e0s 17:15, a Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 18:00 e a Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 18:10.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na Corrida de 10 km, os valores s\u00e3o de 11,00\u20ac at\u00e9 23 de novembro de 2026, 13,00\u20ac at\u00e9 14 de dezembro de 2026, 15,00\u20ac at\u00e9 10 de janeiro de 2027 e 17,00\u20ac \u00e0 \u00faltima hora. Na Caminhada de 5 km, os valores s\u00e3o de 8,00\u20ac (1\u00aa fase), 10,00\u20ac (2\u00aa fase), 12,00\u20ac (3\u00aa fase) e 14,00\u20ac \u00e0 \u00faltima hora. A Corrida Kids \u00e9 gratuita quando acompanhada por um familiar pagante. H\u00e1 ainda op\u00e7\u00e3o de jantar (Sopa da Pedra + Bifana + Bebida) por 5,00\u20ac para atletas e 7,00\u20ac para acompanhantes.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e a que horas funciona o secretariado para entrega do kit de atleta?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A recolha do kit de atleta realiza-se no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova (16 de janeiro de 2027), das 12:30 \u00e0s 16:45, no local da partida (junto \u00e0 Est\u00e1tua, ao lado da sede da Sociedade Euterpe Alhandrense, na zona ribeirinha de Alhandra).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os participantes que cortem a meta recebem medalha Finisher, \u00e1gua e fruta, al\u00e9m de t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (para a Corrida de 10 km) ou t-shirt de algod\u00e3o (para a Caminhada de 5 km), dorsal (com chip RFID nos 10 km), seguro desportivo, diploma eletr\u00f3nico e acesso a banhos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es e pr\u00e9mios na Corrida de 10 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Ser\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina, aos 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (Juniores 15-22 anos, Seniores 23-34, Veteranos I 35-44, Veteranos II 45-54, Veteranos III 55-64 e Veteranos IV +65 anos), \u00e0s 3 melhores equipas e \u00e0 maior equipa. A cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios decorre \u00e0s 20:00.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Corrida do Madeiro \u2013 Alhandra 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-16\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-16\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Zona Ribeirinha de Alhandra, Vila Franca de Xira\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Franca de Xira\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A 1\u00aa Corrida do Madeiro \u2013 Alhandra 2027 realiza-se a 16 de janeiro na zona ribeirinha de Alhandra. Corrida de 10 km, Caminhada de 5 km e Corrida Kids.\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-corrida-do-madeiro-alhandra.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida 10 km\", \"price\": \"11.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/werun.pt\/eventos\/1-corrida-do-madeiro-alhandra\/\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 5 km\", \"price\": \"8.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/werun.pt\/eventos\/1-corrida-do-madeiro-alhandra\/\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida Kids\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/werun.pt\/eventos\/1-corrida-do-madeiro-alhandra\/\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias de Alhandra, S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o dos Montes e Calhandriz\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Corrida do Madeiro \u2013 Alhandra 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 1\u00aa Corrida do Madeiro de Alhandra realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 16 de Janeiro de 2027, na Zona Ribeirinha de Alhandra (junto \u00e0 Est\u00e1tua, ao lado da sede da Sociedade Euterpe Alhandrense), no concelho de Vila Franca de Xira (Lisboa). A Corrida Kids parte \u00e0s 17:15, a Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 18:00 e a Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 18:10.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na Corrida de 10 km, os valores s\u00e3o de 11,00\u20ac at\u00e9 23 de novembro de 2026, 13,00\u20ac at\u00e9 14 de dezembro de 2026, 15,00\u20ac at\u00e9 10 de janeiro de 2027 e 17,00\u20ac \u00e0 \u00faltima hora. Na Caminhada de 5 km, os valores s\u00e3o de 8,00\u20ac (1\u00aa fase), 10,00\u20ac (2\u00aa fase), 12,00\u20ac (3\u00aa fase) e 14,00\u20ac \u00e0 \u00faltima hora. A Corrida Kids \u00e9 gratuita quando acompanhada por um familiar pagante. H\u00e1 ainda op\u00e7\u00e3o de jantar (Sopa da Pedra + Bifana + Bebida) por 5,00\u20ac para atletas e 7,00\u20ac para acompanhantes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e a que horas funciona o secretariado para entrega do kit de atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A recolha do kit de atleta realiza-se no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova (16 de janeiro de 2027), das 12:30 \u00e0s 16:45, no local da partida (junto \u00e0 Est\u00e1tua, ao lado da sede da Sociedade Euterpe Alhandrense, na zona ribeirinha de Alhandra).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todos os participantes que cortem a meta recebem medalha Finisher, \u00e1gua e fruta, al\u00e9m de t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (para a Corrida de 10 km) ou t-shirt de algod\u00e3o (para a Caminhada de 5 km), dorsal (com chip RFID nos 10 km), seguro desportivo, diploma eletr\u00f3nico e acesso a banhos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es e pr\u00e9mios na Corrida de 10 km?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Ser\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina, aos 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (Juniores 15-22 anos, Seniores 23-34, Veteranos I 35-44, Veteranos II 45-54, Veteranos III 55-64 e Veteranos IV +65 anos), \u00e0s 3 melhores equipas e \u00e0 maior equipa. A cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios decorre \u00e0s 20:00.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":73632,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template"